448
00:25:02,118 --> 00:25:02,757
Yes, please.

449
00:25:04,357 --> 00:25:05,174
Is that your dog?

450
00:25:07,374 --> 00:25:08,969
그 강아지 키우시는 거예요?

451
00:25:09,249 --> 00:25:10,771
Yes, she's very friendly.

452
00:25:12,371 --> 00:25:13,455
Could you help me with this?

453
00:25:15,655 --> 00:25:17,267
